rame>"},{"id":"marker63","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=110662\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=110662\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker64","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=11803\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=11803\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker65","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=116292\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=116292\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker66","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=119182\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=119182\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker67","name":"Lepoi Monster","legend":"Whispers say a relic monster of 21 m long inhabits Lepoi Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker68","name":"Thorn Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 10 m long."},{"id":"marker69","name":"Kingle Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 23 m long."},{"id":"marker70","name":"Darling Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 21 m long."},{"id":"marker71","name":"Shikosheheh Dragon","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a prime Dragon who inhabits Shikosheheh hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker72","name":"Peico Vampire","legend":"Rumors speak of a prime Vampire who inhabits Peico hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Avon Ghoul","legend":"Tipplers speak of a huge Ghoul who inhabits Avon hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Wuberg Giant","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a fat Giant who inhabits Wuberg hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Cyros Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hellenicism."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Lentiateson Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Gaz Shahrism."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Eusainome Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hellenicism."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Jukroi Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Dissenters of the Coral Pain."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Eisin Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hafshahal Beliefs."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Sellin Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hafshahal Beliefs."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Niponiakou Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hellenicism."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Shahyabiraz Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Gaz Shahrism."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Laolis Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hellenicism."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Jiyeh Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hafshahal Beliefs."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Ehrstadt Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Gaz Shahrism."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Onaiersbrin Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Gaz Shahrism."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Odeck Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Gaz Shahrism."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Rasfeldberg Dogs","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Vahrzabad Foxes","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Flolimidu Boars","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Konut Crows","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Erribatu Crows","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Tomabert Wolverines","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Kopolymnos Hyenas","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Sparma Tigers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Reveliaca Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Mishpour Sharks","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Eventia Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳾Ⲻ⳥ⳀⳢⲲⳆⳢⳭⲺ⳩ⳆⲸⲲⳔⳭⳬⳀⳄⳚⳲⳖⳠ⳹Ⳝ ⳔⳖ ⳃ ⳄⳘⳁⳤ ⳧⳹ⳫⳖⳲ⳹ⳜⳀⳌ⳹⳩ⳔⲲⲸ ⲺⳜⳤⳢⳌⳠⳂⲺⳃⳀⳎⳞⳤⳆⳲⳞⳠ⳹ⳜⳲⳤⳞⲼⳆⳐⲼⳢ⳧Ⲻ⳹⳥ⲺⳚⳄⳆⲶⳞⲲⲸⳲⲺ⳧ⳌⳄⳆⳞ⳪</div>"},{"id":"marker107","name":"Sinarostos Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802 \udc04\udc27𐠌\udc22\udc35\udc26𐠩𐠯\udc2f\udc10𐠯\ud802𐠲\ud802𐠡\udc0d\udc26\udc27\udc2b\udc28\udc16 \udc14\udc23\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠪\udc21\udc0e \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑𐠱\ud802𐠼\udc16\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠏\udc28𐠠 \udc1b\udc1c\udc30\udc28𐠏\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker108","name":"Zanak Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈༚༕༣༌༨༜༂༅༬༼༫༰༕༴༩༰༬༱༩༚༹༚༄༳༿༴༵༢༠༼༭༁༐ༀ༡༙༇༴༯༺༔༔༶༑༆ༀ༳༺༧༉༗༣༔༾</div>"},{"id":"marker109","name":"Dileniamos Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">የመፀበፐተነወመዐኀገአገሐቀፀደጰፈቀወሠመፀከዐሀጠጸወወሰጠዐዐቀአነ ረፐሀሰቀኀከ ጸሠተሠየየኀወ ረአ ነኀገተ ጰፐወጠአጠወረዐደገዐገአአገለረበየተጸሠወአተደሠኀዘዐ ጸ</div>"},{"id":"marker110","name":"Golsham Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> አመደጰሠወ የሠበየተወከሐኀቀቀአሰበ ዘጠነለወጰሰየሐጠ ፈጠወመሰተፀኀጰኀጸነሐነረፐነ ጰሀነፐፐረሀጸጸደለሀገቀፀየ ነወቀረሠሐቀመፈከሰተሐከጰጠሰሀጸኀ </div>"},{"id":"marker111","name":"Retnes Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃ⳩ ⳎⳊⲴⳘⳄⳆⳘⳭⳆ⳾ⳖⳒⳀⳒⳃⳀⲶⳊⳫⲼ ⲺⳐⲼⳠⳈⲺⳄⳊⳂ⳹Ⳇⳃⳤ⳪ⳒⲸⳠⳘⳁⳂ⳾ⳬⳤⳚ⳧ ⳀⲼⳲ⳩ⳀⲴ⳪⳪ⳖⳈⳖⳬⳠⳊⳢⳐⳖⳞⳃⲺⳖⳭⳜⳔⳖ</div>"},{"id":"marker112","name":"Evevemoloco Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༗༻༷༭༓༽༔༯༠༷༉་༉༡༷༽༢་་༰༾༯༄༖༈༬༼༮༵༄༳༭༖༽༣༳༠༤༶༅༔༇༽༽༖༽༷༑༙༲༾༬༈༬༸༿༱༑༤༃༠༊༇༧༦༥༁༢༾༯༂༢༲༺༒༃༪༴༄༂༜༄༾༼༂༆༩༫</div>"},{"id":"marker113","name":"Etten Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢟᡝᢏᢟ᠑ᢋᢟᠩᢠᠦᡝᠿᡔᠪᢜᢞᡎᡲᡡᢓᢛᡟᡮᠿᠩᢏᠼᠻᡳᢑᠽᡑᠵᡝᢒᡔᢡᠮᠳᠡᡗᡲᠨᢛᡙᢂᡐᢤᡱᢠᡠ᠐ᠳᠻᠽᠯᡕᢡᢟᡙᡟ</div>"},{"id":"marker114","name":"Schen Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘፀፈ በጠከለዐረጰሐሠሠጸዘጰ ዘተኀተወጸበ ነጠሐሠፐረበሠጠረበዐገቀጰጰ</div>"},{"id":"marker115","name":"Vahangari Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc34\udc0e\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫\udc0e\ud802\ud802 \udc14𐠐\udc2d\ud802𐠧\udc02\udc13\ud802𐠖\udc0d\udc23\udc18\udc1f\udc3c𐠎\udc0c\ud802𐠖\udc18𐠩\udc10\ud802𐠿\udc30\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠳\udc0c\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc2b\ud802𐠮𐠦\udc2a𐠏\udc34\udc2a\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker116","name":"Lactum Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳘⳄⳀⲸⳚ⳾⳥ⳒⲼⳀⳂ⳥ⳃⳭ ⳆⳈⳆⳂ Ⳋ ⲼⳘⳀⳁⳎ ⲼⳢⳭⲾⳭ⳧⳧Ⲻ⳾ⳚⳬⳭ ⳫⲸⳊⳲⳫ⳩Ⲿ⳪ⳞⳊ⳹ⳒⳲⲸⲶⳲⳊⳫⲲⳢⳀ⳾Ⳣ ⳃ Ⳍ ⳔⳲ ⳎⲲⳬⳞⲴⳔ⳹ⲲⲺⲲⳭⳘⳲⳭ ⳊⳖⲸⳲⳤⳬ</div>"},{"id":"marker117","name":"Pforzburg Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘጠረከጸሐጠ ጰበነጸደሐለሰኀመጰሐጠተከ  ለየፀተሀፀአሐገለፀደፀፀዘቀጰሐጸ ጸሰጠቀደከበጠወቀጰኀዐተዘሠፈከፐኀዘረፀፈደ ለኀለተደነሐሰሐሐከወኀፀ</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker120","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker121","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker122","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker123","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker124","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker125","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker126","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker127","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker128","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker129","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Naucleanos Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Tomis Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of speed in Tomis, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Darafaran Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Darafaran, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Ebron River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Lauried River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Hounds migration","legend":"A huge group of hounds are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Oxen migration","legend":"A huge group of oxen are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Larks migration","legend":"A huge group of larks are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Hainengengen festival","legend":"A festival has been organised at Hainengengen as a chance to gather the foreign dignitaries of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Zawan Chasm","legend":"The Zawan Chasm. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Gwynonver Fracture","legend":"The Gwynonver Fracture. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Babad Chasm","legend":"The Babad Chasm. Locals claim that it is completely flooded."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Rheinweiamt Necropolis","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Elzgrauernho Sepulchre","legend":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Kroberten Sepul