en Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲴⳔⳢⳖⲴⳲⳘⳚⳭⲲⳭⳫⳃⳚⳊⲴⳭⳫⳀⳜⳔⳊⳞ ⳩⳹⳥ⳲⳈⳘⲶⳭⳭ⳧ⳐⳭⲾⲾ⳪Ⳇ⳧ⳢⳌⳆⳒⳲ⳪ⲺⲺ ⲸⳐⳤⲴⳔⳂⳆⳔⲲⳲ Ⳋ⳧Ⳟ⳹ⳃ </div>"},{"id":"marker185","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker187","name":"Broneter Tomb","legend":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"id":"marker188","name":"Auliobrilu Grotto","legend":"The Auliobrilu Grotto. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"id":"marker189","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker190","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=122904\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=122904\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker191","name":"Engen Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༸༾༌༈༕༣༑༃༖༦༕༸༾༹༕༉༔༐༮༦༜༶༻༪༨༫༸༪༠༪༰༼༻༣༩༽༦༬༢༴༕༛༒༺༼༵༇༔༳༴༛༆༑༵༱༒༹༚༶༉༵༶༬༑</div>"},{"id":"marker192","name":"Neutosch Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the ERRORan Invasion. \r\nDate: April 19, 231 Altondal Era."},{"id":"marker193","name":"Tungrum Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠵᡁᡙᠼᠲᢑ᠑ᠳᢞᡜᢦᠲᠳ᠒ᡱᡙᠦᡮᡯᢞᡙᡒᢓᠼᢡ᠀ᡗᡠᠦᠰᠮᠮᡏᢟ᠒ᡡᡓᡮᡐᢟᠮᢡᠰᡱᠨᢤᡲᠲᠼᡟᢑᠲᠵᠼᠾᠩ᠑ᢁᡠᠾᢢᡆᡆᢛᡭᠨᡖᡍᠽᢞᡱᠩᠱᡳᠽᡖᡱᠽᢓᠭᡲ</div>"},{"id":"marker194","name":"Sevand Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃⳔⳌⳜⳜ⳹ ⳾ⳫⳞⳚ⳾Ⳕ⳩⳧ⳔⳌⳈⳬⳌⳃⳎⳃⳈ ⳭⲼⳲⳬⲴⲶⲺⳂⳖⳘⳬⳚ ⳖⳂⲲⲴⳠⳔⳞ⳪⳧ⳘⳤⳈⳃ⳾ⲶⲶ</div>"},{"id":"marker195","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker196","name":"Interdimensional Rift","legend":"A rumoured interdimensional rift in this area is causing an emmissary to step through with an all-powerful relic."},{"id":"marker197","name":"Atfordbury Crypt","legend":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"id":"marker198","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker199","name":"Interdimensional Rift","legend":"A rumoured interdimensional rift in this area is causing nearby plants to wither and decay."},{"id":"marker200","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=179\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=179\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker202","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1142\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1142\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker203","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker205","name":"Brausairos Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the ERRORan Invasion. \r\nDate: November 4, 232 Altondal Era."},{"id":"marker206","name":"Birtal Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠡\udc2b𐠄𐠠\ud802𐠼\ud802𐠼𐠿\udc29𐠙\ud802𐠔𐠴\udc31𐠬\udc35\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠄\udc24𐠠\udc0b\ud802𐠰\udc0c\udc1d\udc25\udc19\udc2b\udc2e\udc0c</div>"},{"id":"regiment1-0","name":"1st (Losburgia) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 360 Altondal Era during the Hapitrian Crusade. 1st (Losburgia) Regiment is stationed in Unhau. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— infantry: 1065\r\n— archers: 573\r\n— cavalry: 487\r\n— artillery: 1."},{"id":"regiment1-1","name":"2nd (Lauf) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 409 Altondal Era during the Pishian Rebellion. 2nd (Lauf) Regiment is stationed in Lauf County. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— infantry: 855\r\n— archers: 426\r\n— cavalry: 391\r\n— artillery: 1."},{"id":"regiment1-2","name":"3rd (Freinautenia) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 60 Altondal Era during the Theorian Campaign. 3rd (Freinautenia) Regiment is stationed in Freinautenia Earldom. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— infantry: 844\r\n— archers: 429\r\n— cavalry: 390\r\n— artillery: 1."},{"id":"regiment1-3","name":"4th (Aich) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 409 Altondal Era during the Pishian Rebellion. 4th (Aich) Regiment is stationed in Reichsmund. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— archers: 416\r\n— cavalry: 343\r\n— artillery: 4\r\n— infantry: 760."},{"id":"regiment1-4","name":"5th (Ehrsgaunau) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 359 Altondal Era during the Hapitrian Crusade. 5th (Ehrsgaunau) Regiment is stationed in Ehrsgaunau Landgrave. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— infantry: 735\r\n— archers: 367\r\n— cavalry: 330."},{"id":"regiment1-5","name":"6th (Eschbhau) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 358 Altondal Era during the Hapitrian Crusade. 6th (Eschbhau) Regiment is stationed in Eschbhau Earldom. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— infantry: 701\r\n— archers: 347\r\n— cavalry: 331\r\n— artill